      "body": "## Motivation\r\n\r\nMiniMax sparse kernels were migrated from `sglang.srt.layers.attention.minimax_sparse_ops` to `sglang.kernels.ops.attention.minimax_sparse` in #30793.\r\n\r\nThe FP8 regression test `test_fp8_attn_gemm.py` was later introduced by #30971. Work on #30971 started before the kernel migration was merged, and this test retained the pre-migration import paths when it was eventually merged.\r\n\r\nAs a result, the test currently fails during collection on the latest `main` branch with:\r\n\r\n```text\r\nModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'sglang.srt.layers.attention.minimax_sparse_ops.decode'\r\n```\r\nThis PR updates those stale imports to the canonical kernel paths established by #30793, allowing the existing MiniMax FP8 attention GEMM regression tests to be collected and run again.\r\n\r\n## Modifications\r\n\r\nUpdated 4 imports in:\r\n\r\n```\r\npython/sglang/srt/layers/attention/minimax_sparse_ops/tests/test_fp8_attn_gemm.py\r\n```\r\nThe imports were changed from the pre-migration runtime paths:\r\n```\r\nsglang.srt.layers.attention.minimax_sparse_ops...\r\n```\r\nto the current kernel paths:\r\n\r\n```\r\nsglang.kernels.ops.attention.minimax_sparse...\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Validation\r\n\r\nThis PR only fixes test imports and does not affect model outputs or runtime behavior.\r\n\r\nValidation before the fix:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 -m pytest -q\r\npython/sglang/srt/layers/attention/minimax_sparse_ops/tests/test_fp8_attn_gemm.py\r\n--collect-only\r\n```\r\nResult before the fix:\r\n```\r\nModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'sglang.srt.layers.attention.minimax_sparse_ops.decode'\r\n```\r\nResult after the fix:\r\n```\r\n10 tests collected\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #34456483378](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/34456483378)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run 